## face

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":| face =\n    | One\n    | Two\n    | Three\n    | Four\n    | Five\n    | Six\n\n:= digit \\* t {number}. (f : face) : t =\n    conv (!!!!UnionTag(f) : i32)\n\n:= pips (f : face) : u8 =\n    digit f + 1u8\n\n:= face_of_digit (d : i32) : face =\n    ?= d ?|\n    | 0 => One\n    | 1 => Two\n    | 2 => Three\n    | 3 => Four\n    | 4 => Five\n    | _ => Six\n\n:= face_of_pips (p : u8) : option face =\n    ? p >= 1u8 && p <= 6u8 ?> Some (face_of_digit (conv (p - 1u8))) |: None\n\n:= face_of_byte (b : u8) : option face =\n    ? b < 252u8 ?> Some (face_of_digit (conv (b % 6u8))) |: None","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :| face =
      | One
      | Two
      | Three
      | Four
      | Five
      | Six

  := digit \* t {number}. (f : face) : t =
      conv (!!!!UnionTag(f) : i32)

  := pips (f : face) : u8 =
      digit f + 1u8

  := face_of_digit (d : i32) : face =
      ?= d ?|
      | 0 => One
      | 1 => Two
      | 2 => Three
      | 3 => Four
      | 4 => Five
      | _ => Six

  := face_of_pips (p : u8) : option face =
      ? p >= 1u8 && p <= 6u8 ?> Some (face_of_digit (conv (p - 1u8))) |: None

  := face_of_byte (b : u8) : option face =
      ? b < 252u8 ?> Some (face_of_digit (conv (b % 6u8))) |: None
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### every_face_round_trips_through_its_pips (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> rust\n///> fsharp\n///> typescript\n///> python\n///> lua\n///> c\n///> zig\n///> gleam\n///> pascal\n\n:= ~low = 0u8\n(\n    listm.map (pips >> face_of_pips) [ One; Two; Three; Four; Five; Six ]\n    |> listm.map (optionm.map pips),\n    face_of_pips low,\n    face_of_pips (low + 7u8)\n)\n|> _assert_eq ([ Some 1u8; Some 2; Some 3; Some 4; Some 5; Some 6 ], None, None)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> rust
  ///> fsharp
  ///> typescript
  ///> python
  ///> lua
  ///> c
  ///> zig
  ///> gleam
  ///> pascal

  := ~low = 0u8
  (
      listm.map (pips >> face_of_pips) [ One; Two; Three; Four; Five; Six ]
      |> listm.map (optionm.map pips),
      face_of_pips low,
      face_of_pips (low + 7u8)
  )
  |> _assert_eq ([ Some 1u8; Some 2; Some 3; Some 4; Some 5; Some 6 ], None, None)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= face_counts () : array i32 =\n    := counts : array i32 = create 7\n    :~ ^ clear (i : i32) : () =\n        ? i < 7 ?>\n            set counts i 0\n            clear (i + 1)\n    clear 0\n    :~ ^ go (b : i32) : () =\n        ? b <= 255 ?>\n            := slot =\n                ?= face_of_byte (conv b) ?|\n                | Some f => digit f\n                | None => 6i32\n            set counts slot (index counts slot + 1)\n            go (b + 1)\n    go 0\n    counts","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := face_counts () : array i32 =
      := counts : array i32 = create 7
      :~ ^ clear (i : i32) : () =
          ? i < 7 ?>
              set counts i 0
              clear (i + 1)
      clear 0
      :~ ^ go (b : i32) : () =
          ? b <= 255 ?>
              := slot =
                  ?= face_of_byte (conv b) ?|
                  | Some f => digit f
                  | None => 6i32
              set counts slot (index counts slot + 1)
              go (b + 1)
      go 0
      counts
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

