#### bound_of_rejects_empty_and_oversized_ranges (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> rust\n///> fsharp\n///> typescript\n///> python\n///> lua\n///> c\n///> zig\n///> gleam\n///> pascal\n\n:= ~zero = 0u64\n:= ~over = 4738381338321616897u64\n:= text (r : result (bound u64) (bound_error u64)) =\n    ?= r ?|\n    | Ok b => #?(bound_value b)\n    | Error e => bound_error_text e\n(text (bound_of zero), text (bound_of over), text (bound_of (zero + 2000u64)))\n|> _assert_eq (\n    \"max must be at least 1\",\n    \"max: 4738381338321616897 is above the largest supported bound 4738381338321616896\",\n    \"2000\"\n)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> rust
  ///> fsharp
  ///> typescript
  ///> python
  ///> lua
  ///> c
  ///> zig
  ///> gleam
  ///> pascal

  := ~zero = 0u64
  := ~over = 4738381338321616897u64
  := text (r : result (bound u64) (bound_error u64)) =
      ?= r ?|
      | Ok b => #?(bound_value b)
      | Error e => bound_error_text e
  (text (bound_of zero), text (bound_of over), text (bound_of (zero + 2000u64)))
  |> _assert_eq (
      "max must be at least 1",
      "max: 4738381338321616897 is above the largest supported bound 4738381338321616896",
      "2000"
  )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= count_of \\* t {number}. (max : t) : i32 =\n    ?= bound_of max ?|\n    | Ok b => dice_count b\n    | Error _ => -1","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := count_of \* t {number}. (max : t) : i32 =
      ?= bound_of max ?|
      | Ok b => dice_count b
      | Error _ => -1
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

