## hand

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= hand_value \\* t {number}. (b : bound t) (count : i32) (hand : list face) : option t =\n    := max = bound_value b\n    :~ ^ go (left : i32) (faces : list face) (value : t) : option t =\n        ? left <= 0\n        ?> ? value < max ?> Some (value + 1) |: None\n        |:\n            ?= faces ?|\n            | f :: rest =>\n                := d = digit f\n                ? d >= max || value > (max - 1 - d) / 6 ?> None |: go (left - 1) rest (value * 6 + d)\n            | [] => None\n    go count hand 0\n\n:= faces_of_pips (rolls : list u8) : option (list face) =\n    :~ ^ go (rolls : list u8) (acc : list face) : option (list face) =\n        ?= rolls ?|\n        | r :: rest =>\n            ?= face_of_pips r ?|\n            | Some f => go rest (f :: acc)\n            | None => None\n        | [] => Some (listm.rev acc)\n    go rolls []\n\n:= roll_within_bounds \\* t {number}. (max : t) (rolls : list u8) : option t =\n    ?= bound_of max, faces_of_pips rolls ?|\n    | Ok b, Some hand => hand_value b (listm.length hand) hand\n    | _ => None","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := hand_value \* t {number}. (b : bound t) (count : i32) (hand : list face) : option t =
      := max = bound_value b
      :~ ^ go (left : i32) (faces : list face) (value : t) : option t =
          ? left <= 0
          ?> ? value < max ?> Some (value + 1) |: None
          |:
              ?= faces ?|
              | f :: rest =>
                  := d = digit f
                  ? d >= max || value > (max - 1 - d) / 6 ?> None |: go (left - 1) rest (value * 6 + d)
              | [] => None
      go count hand 0

  := faces_of_pips (rolls : list u8) : option (list face) =
      :~ ^ go (rolls : list u8) (acc : list face) : option (list face) =
          ?= rolls ?|
          | r :: rest =>
              ?= face_of_pips r ?|
              | Some f => go rest (f :: acc)
              | None => None
          | [] => Some (listm.rev acc)
      go rolls []

  := roll_within_bounds \* t {number}. (max : t) (rolls : list u8) : option t =
      ?= bound_of max, faces_of_pips rolls ?|
      | Ok b, Some hand => hand_value b (listm.length hand) hand
      | _ => None
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

