<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ^ faces (from : u8) : list u8 = ? from > 6 ?> [] |: from :: faces (from + 1)\n\n:~ ^ pair_results (firsts : list u8) (acc : list (option i32)) : list (option i32) =\n    ?= firsts ?|\n    | a :: rest => pair_results rest (listm.fold (\\ acc b => roll_within_bounds 20i32 [ a; b ] :: acc) acc (faces 1))\n    | [] => acc\n\n:~ ^ occurrences (v : i32) (results : list (option i32)) (n : i32) : i32 =\n    ?= results ?|\n    | Some x :: rest => occurrences v rest (? x = v ?> n + 1 |: n)\n    | None :: rest => occurrences v rest n\n    | [] => n\n\n:~ ^ values_seen_once (v : i32) (results : list (option i32)) : bool =\n    ? v > 20i32 ?> !+ |: occurrences v results 0 = 1 && values_seen_once (v + 1) results","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ^ faces (from : u8) : list u8 = ? from > 6 ?> [] |: from :: faces (from + 1)

  :~ ^ pair_results (firsts : list u8) (acc : list (option i32)) : list (option i32) =
      ?= firsts ?|
      | a :: rest => pair_results rest (listm.fold (\ acc b => roll_within_bounds 20i32 [ a; b ] :: acc) acc (faces 1))
      | [] => acc

  :~ ^ occurrences (v : i32) (results : list (option i32)) (n : i32) : i32 =
      ?= results ?|
      | Some x :: rest => occurrences v rest (? x = v ?> n + 1 |: n)
      | None :: rest => occurrences v rest n
      | [] => n

  :~ ^ values_seen_once (v : i32) (results : list (option i32)) : bool =
      ? v > 20i32 ?> !+ |: occurrences v results 0 = 1 && values_seen_once (v + 1) results
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### every_two_roll_sequence_maps_to_one_value_so_accepted_rolls_are_uniform (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> rust\n///> fsharp\n///> typescript\n///> python\n///> lua\n///> c\n///> zig\n///> gleam\n///> pascal\n\n:= results = pair_results (faces 1) []\n:= rejected = listm.fold (\\ n r => ?= r ?| Some _ => n | None => n + 1i32) 0i32 results\n(values_seen_once 1i32 results, rejected) |> _assert_eq (!+, 16i32)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> rust
  ///> fsharp
  ///> typescript
  ///> python
  ///> lua
  ///> c
  ///> zig
  ///> gleam
  ///> pascal

  := results = pair_results (faces 1) []
  := rejected = listm.fold (\ n r => ?= r ?| Some _ => n | None => n + 1i32) 0i32 results
  (values_seen_once 1i32 results, rejected) |> _assert_eq (!+, 16i32)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

## sources

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":? draw_face s : s -> face * s\n\n:! replay = { all : list face; rest : list face }\n\n:= replayed (faces : list face) : replay =\n    replay { all = faces; rest = faces }\n\n:+ draw_face replay =\n    \\ (replay { all rest }) =>\n        ?= rest ?|\n        | f :: rest => f, replay { all = all; rest = rest }\n        | [] =>\n            ?= all ?|\n            | f :: rest => f, replay { all = all; rest = rest }\n            | [] => One, replay { all = all; rest = [] }\n\n:! system = ()\n\n:+ draw_face system =\n    \\ s => face_of_digit (random' 0i32 6i32), s\n\n:! roller = () -> u8\n\n:~ ^ draw_rolled (roll : () -> u8) : face =\n    ?= face_of_pips (roll ()) ?|\n    | Some f => f\n    | None => draw_rolled roll\n\n:+ draw_face roller =\n    \\ (roller roll) => draw_rolled roll, roller roll\n\n:! hash_faces h = { hasher : h; digest : array u8; at : i32 }\n\n:= hashed \\* h. (hasher : h) (digest : array u8) : hash_faces h =\n    hash_faces { hasher = hasher; digest = digest; at = 0 }\n\n:~ ^ draw_hashed \\* h {digest_with}. (hasher : h) (digest : array u8) (at : i32) : face * hash_faces h =\n    ? at >= length digest\n    ?> draw_hashed hasher (digest_with hasher digest) 0\n    |:\n        ?= face_of_byte (index digest at) ?|\n        | Some f => f, hash_faces { hasher = hasher; digest = digest; at = at + 1 }\n        | None => draw_hashed hasher digest (at + 1)\n\n:+ draw_face hash_faces h {digest_with} =\n    \\ (hash_faces { hasher digest at }) => draw_hashed hasher digest at","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :? draw_face s : s -> face * s

  :! replay = { all : list face; rest : list face }

  := replayed (faces : list face) : replay =
      replay { all = faces; rest = faces }

  :+ draw_face replay =
      \ (replay { all rest }) =>
          ?= rest ?|
          | f :: rest => f, replay { all = all; rest = rest }
          | [] =>
              ?= all ?|
              | f :: rest => f, replay { all = all; rest = rest }
              | [] => One, replay { all = all; rest = [] }

  :! system = ()

  :+ draw_face system =
      \ s => face_of_digit (random' 0i32 6i32), s

  :! roller = () -> u8

  :~ ^ draw_rolled (roll : () -> u8) : face =
      ?= face_of_pips (roll ()) ?|
      | Some f => f
      | None => draw_rolled roll

  :+ draw_face roller =
      \ (roller roll) => draw_rolled roll, roller roll

  :! hash_faces h = { hasher : h; digest : array u8; at : i32 }

  := hashed \* h. (hasher : h) (digest : array u8) : hash_faces h =
      hash_faces { hasher = hasher; digest = digest; at = 0 }

  :~ ^ draw_hashed \* h {digest_with}. (hasher : h) (digest : array u8) (at : i32) : face * hash_faces h =
      ? at >= length digest
      ?> draw_hashed hasher (digest_with hasher digest) 0
      |:
          ?= face_of_byte (index digest at) ?|
          | Some f => f, hash_faces { hasher = hasher; digest = digest; at = at + 1 }
          | None => draw_hashed hasher digest (at + 1)

  :+ draw_face hash_faces h {digest_with} =
      \ (hash_faces { hasher digest at }) => draw_hashed hasher digest at
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

## roll

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":| reroll =\n    | Fresh\n    | Slide\n    | Recycle\n\n:~ ^ roll_hand \\* s {draw_face}. (count : i32) (hand : list face) (source : s) : list face * s =\n    ? count <= 0\n    ?> hand, source\n    |:\n        := f, source = draw_face source\n        roll_hand (count - 1) (f :: hand) source\n\n:~ ^ roll_slid \\* t {number} s {draw_face}. (b : bound t) (count : i32) (hand : list face) (source : s) : t * s =\n    ?= hand_value b count hand ?|\n    | Some value => value, source\n    | None =>\n        := f, source = draw_face source\n        roll_slid b count (f :: hand) source\n\n:~ ^ roll_fresh \\* t {number} s {draw_face}. (b : bound t) (count : i32) (source : s) : t * s =\n    :~ ^ read (left : i32) (place : t) (value : t) (source : s) : t * s =\n        ? left <= 0\n        ?> value, source\n        |:\n            := f, source = draw_face source\n            read (left - 1) (place * 6) (value + digit f * place) source\n    := value, source = read count 1 0 source\n    ? value < bound_value b ?> value + 1, source |: roll_fresh b count source\n\n:! pool t = { value : t; range : t }\n\n:= empty_pool \\* t {number}. () : pool t =\n    pool { value = 0; range = 1 }\n\n:= settle \\* t {number}. (b : bound t) ((pool { value range }) : pool t) : result t (pool t) =\n    := max = bound_value b\n    := whole = range / max * max\n    ? value < whole ?> Ok (value % max + 1) |: Error (pool { value = value - whole; range = range - whole })\n\n:= with_die \\* t {number}. ((pool { value range }) : pool t) (f : face) : pool t =\n    ? range > (limit.max : t) / 6\n    ?> pool { value = digit f; range = 6 }\n    |: pool { value = value * 6 + digit f; range = range * 6 }\n\n:~ ^ roll_recycled \\* t {number} s {draw_face}. (b : bound t) (p : pool t) (source : s) : t * s =\n    ?= settle b p ?|\n    | Ok value => value, source\n    | Error p =>\n        := f, source = draw_face source\n        roll_recycled b (with_die p f) source\n\n:= roll \\* t {number} s {draw_face}. (policy : reroll) (b : bound t) (source : s) : t * s =\n    := count = dice_count b\n    ?= policy ?|\n    | Recycle => roll_recycled b (empty_pool ()) source\n    | Fresh => roll_fresh b count source\n    | Slide =>\n        := hand, source = roll_hand count [] source\n        roll_slid b count hand source\n\n:= roll_value \\* t {number} s {draw_face}. (policy : reroll) (max : t) (source : s) : t =\n    ?= bound_of max ?|\n    | Ok b => fst (roll policy b source)\n    | Error e => failwith (bound_error_text e)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :| reroll =
      | Fresh
      | Slide
      | Recycle

  :~ ^ roll_hand \* s {draw_face}. (count : i32) (hand : list face) (source : s) : list face * s =
      ? count <= 0
      ?> hand, source
      |:
          := f, source = draw_face source
          roll_hand (count - 1) (f :: hand) source

  :~ ^ roll_slid \* t {number} s {draw_face}. (b : bound t) (count : i32) (hand : list face) (source : s) : t * s =
      ?= hand_value b count hand ?|
      | Some value => value, source
      | None =>
          := f, source = draw_face source
          roll_slid b count (f :: hand) source

  :~ ^ roll_fresh \* t {number} s {draw_face}. (b : bound t) (count : i32) (source : s) : t * s =
      :~ ^ read (left : i32) (place : t) (value : t) (source : s) : t * s =
          ? left <= 0
          ?> value, source
          |:
              := f, source = draw_face source
              read (left - 1) (place * 6) (value + digit f * place) source
      := value, source = read count 1 0 source
      ? value < bound_value b ?> value + 1, source |: roll_fresh b count source

  :! pool t = { value : t; range : t }

  := empty_pool \* t {number}. () : pool t =
      pool { value = 0; range = 1 }

  := settle \* t {number}. (b : bound t) ((pool { value range }) : pool t) : result t (pool t) =
      := max = bound_value b
      := whole = range / max * max
      ? value < whole ?> Ok (value % max + 1) |: Error (pool { value = value - whole; range = range - whole })

  := with_die \* t {number}. ((pool { value range }) : pool t) (f : face) : pool t =
      ? range > (limit.max : t) / 6
      ?> pool { value = digit f; range = 6 }
      |: pool { value = value * 6 + digit f; range = range * 6 }

  :~ ^ roll_recycled \* t {number} s {draw_face}. (b : bound t) (p : pool t) (source : s) : t * s =
      ?= settle b p ?|
      | Ok value => value, source
      | Error p =>
          := f, source = draw_face source
          roll_recycled b (with_die p f) source

  := roll \* t {number} s {draw_face}. (policy : reroll) (b : bound t) (source : s) : t * s =
      := count = dice_count b
      ?= policy ?|
      | Recycle => roll_recycled b (empty_pool ()) source
      | Fresh => roll_fresh b count source
      | Slide =>
          := hand, source = roll_hand count [] source
          roll_slid b count hand source

  := roll_value \* t {number} s {draw_face}. (policy : reroll) (max : t) (source : s) : t =
      ?= bound_of max ?|
      | Ok b => fst (roll policy b source)
      | Error e => failwith (bound_error_text e)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

