<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ^ histogram_misses (policy : reroll) (max : i32) (draws : i32) (seen : list i32) : i32 =\n    ? draws <= 0\n    ?> listm'.init_series 1i32 max 1i32 |> listm.fold (\\ misses v => ? listm.fold (\\ found x => found || x = v) !- seen ?> misses |: misses + 1) 0i32\n    |:\n        := value = roll_value policy max system\n        ? value < 1 || value > max ?> -1i32 |: histogram_misses policy max (draws - 1) (value :: seen)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ^ histogram_misses (policy : reroll) (max : i32) (draws : i32) (seen : list i32) : i32 =
      ? draws <= 0
      ?> listm'.init_series 1i32 max 1i32 |> listm.fold (\ misses v => ? listm.fold (\ found x => found || x = v) !- seen ?> misses |: misses + 1) 0i32
      |:
          := value = roll_value policy max system
          ? value < 1 || value > max ?> -1i32 |: histogram_misses policy max (draws - 1) (value :: seen)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

