<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":! counted s = { inner : s; drawn : i32 }\n\n:+ draw_face counted s {draw_face} =\n    \\ (counted { inner drawn }) =>\n        := f, inner = draw_face inner\n        f, counted { inner = inner; drawn = drawn + 1 }\n\n:~ ^ recycled_outcome \\* t {number}. (b : bound t) (p : pool t) (faces : list face) : option t =\n    ?= settle b p ?|\n    | Ok value => Some value\n    | Error p =>\n        ?= faces ?|\n        | f :: rest => recycled_outcome b (with_die p f) rest\n        | [] => None\n\n:= outcome_spread (max : i32) : i32 * i32 * i32 =\n    := counts : array i32 = create (max + 1)\n    :~ ^ clear (i : i32) : () =\n        ? i <= max ?>\n            set counts i 0\n            clear (i + 1)\n    clear 0\n    ?= bound_of max ?|\n    | Ok b =>\n        :~ ^ tally (sequence : i32) : () =\n            ? sequence < 216 ?>\n                := faces = [ face_of_digit (sequence / 36); face_of_digit (sequence / 6 % 6); face_of_digit (sequence % 6) ]\n                := slot =\n                    ?= recycled_outcome b (empty_pool ()) faces ?|\n                    | Some value => value\n                    | None => 0\n                set counts slot (index counts slot + 1)\n                tally (sequence + 1)\n        tally 0\n    | Error _ => ()\n    :~ ^ spread (i : i32) (low : i32) (high : i32) : i32 * i32 =\n        ? i > max ?> low, high |: spread (i + 1) (? index counts i < low ?> index counts i |: low) (? index counts i > high ?> index counts i |: high)\n    := low, high = spread 1 1000 0\n    low, high, index counts 0","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :! counted s = { inner : s; drawn : i32 }

  :+ draw_face counted s {draw_face} =
      \ (counted { inner drawn }) =>
          := f, inner = draw_face inner
          f, counted { inner = inner; drawn = drawn + 1 }

  :~ ^ recycled_outcome \* t {number}. (b : bound t) (p : pool t) (faces : list face) : option t =
      ?= settle b p ?|
      | Ok value => Some value
      | Error p =>
          ?= faces ?|
          | f :: rest => recycled_outcome b (with_die p f) rest
          | [] => None

  := outcome_spread (max : i32) : i32 * i32 * i32 =
      := counts : array i32 = create (max + 1)
      :~ ^ clear (i : i32) : () =
          ? i <= max ?>
              set counts i 0
              clear (i + 1)
      clear 0
      ?= bound_of max ?|
      | Ok b =>
          :~ ^ tally (sequence : i32) : () =
              ? sequence < 216 ?>
                  := faces = [ face_of_digit (sequence / 36); face_of_digit (sequence / 6 % 6); face_of_digit (sequence % 6) ]
                  := slot =
                      ?= recycled_outcome b (empty_pool ()) faces ?|
                      | Some value => value
                      | None => 0
                  set counts slot (index counts slot + 1)
                  tally (sequence + 1)
          tally 0
      | Error _ => ()
      :~ ^ spread (i : i32) (low : i32) (high : i32) : i32 * i32 =
          ? i > max ?> low, high |: spread (i + 1) (? index counts i < low ?> index counts i |: low) (? index counts i > high ?> index counts i |: high)
      := low, high = spread 1 1000 0
      low, high, index counts 0
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### recycling_is_exact_over_every_three_dice_sequence (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> rust\n///> fsharp\n///> typescript\n///> python\n///> lua\n///> c\n///> zig\n///> gleam\n///> pascal\n\n:= ~five = 5i32\n(outcome_spread five, outcome_spread (five + 2), outcome_spread (five * 4))\n|> _assert_eq ((43i32, 43i32, 1i32), (30i32, 30i32, 6i32), (10i32, 10i32, 16i32))","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

