#### a_recycled_keccak_stream_rolls_the_same_values_on_every_backend (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> rust\n///> fsharp\n///> typescript\n///> python\n///> lua\n///> c\n///> zig\n///> gleam\n///> pascal\n\n:= ~seed_size = 3i32\nrecycled_values 6 (hashed keccak.spiral_keccak (bytes.counting seed_size)) []\n|> _assert_eq [ 321u64; 1537; 145; 1654; 1384; 761 ]","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> rust
  ///> fsharp
  ///> typescript
  ///> python
  ///> lua
  ///> c
  ///> zig
  ///> gleam
  ///> pascal

  := ~seed_size = 3i32
  recycled_values 6 (hashed keccak.spiral_keccak (bytes.counting seed_size)) []
  |> _assert_eq [ 321u64; 1537; 145; 1654; 1384; 761 ]
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ^ faces_drawn (policy : reroll) (b : bound u64) (left : i32) (source : counted (hash_faces keccak.spiral_keccak)) : i32 =\n    ? left <= 0\n    ?> (\\ (counted { inner drawn }) => drawn) source\n    |:\n        := _, source = roll policy b source\n        faces_drawn policy b (left - 1) source\n\n:= faces_for (policy : reroll) (max : u64) : i32 =\n    := source = counted { inner = hashed keccak.spiral_keccak (bytes.counting 3i32); drawn = 0 }\n    ?= bound_of max ?|\n    | Ok b => faces_drawn policy b 20 source\n    | Error _ => -1","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ^ faces_drawn (policy : reroll) (b : bound u64) (left : i32) (source : counted (hash_faces keccak.spiral_keccak)) : i32 =
      ? left <= 0
      ?> (\ (counted { inner drawn }) => drawn) source
      |:
          := _, source = roll policy b source
          faces_drawn policy b (left - 1) source

  := faces_for (policy : reroll) (max : u64) : i32 =
      := source = counted { inner = hashed keccak.spiral_keccak (bytes.counting 3i32); drawn = 0 }
      ?= bound_of max ?|
      | Ok b => faces_drawn policy b 20 source
      | Error _ => -1
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

