## rotate_number

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= rotate_number \\* t {number}. (max : i64) (n : t) : t =\n    (conv n - 1 + max) % max + 1 |> conv\n\n:= rotate_numbers max items =\n    items |> stream.map (rotate_number max)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := rotate_number \* t {number}. (max : i64) (n : t) : t =
      (conv n - 1 + max) % max + 1 |> conv

  := rotate_numbers max items =
      items |> stream.map (rotate_number max)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

